  "description": "The Best Optimized is made for performance and customizability\n\nThis pack grants lots of fps while Having lightweight versions",
  "body": "                                  The Best Optimized is the best optimization pack out there\n\nThis is a modpack the intends on giving the best performance to the user and Infinite customizability\n\n\nThis modpack is a collection of mods listed in the [dependency's](https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-best-optimized/version/1.0.0-1.20.3 'Click')\n\nThis Modpack is better because it has WAY more customizability  then other packs like [Simply Optimized](https://modrinth.com/modpack/sop 'Click'), [Additive](https://modrinth.com/modpack/additive 'Click'), [Adrenaline](https://modrinth.com/modpack/adrenaline 'Click'), and [Fabulously optimized](https://modrinth.com/modpack/fabulously-optimized 'Click') \n\n**The modpack will be updated when a new minecraft version comes out**\n\n[![TinyNote](https://modfolio.creeperkatze.dev/modrinth/user/TinyNote)](https://modrinth.com/user/TinyNote)\n\n",
